  faqs:[{q:'Is Claude Code cheaper than Cursor?',a:'At the entry level Cursor is cheaper: Plus is $8/mo versus $20/mo for Claude Pro, but Plus only includes Grok models. If you want Claude models, Claude Pro includes them in its usage, while Cursor bills Claude separately at API list price on Premium ($30/mo) and up. At the top end both have $100 and $200 tiers.'},{q:'Can I still use Claude models in Cursor?',a:'Yes, on Premium and higher. Third-party models such as Claude and GPT are not included in the plan allowance and are billed separately by usage at API list price. The Plus plan includes Grok models only.'},{q:'Does Claude Code cost extra on top of a Claude subscription?',a:'No. Claude Code is included in all paid Claude plans (Pro, Max, Ultra, Team and Enterprise) and shares the plan\'s usage limits with Claude chat. It is not included on the Free plan. You can also run it on pay-as-you-go API credits through a Console account.'},{q:'Do the API credits in Claude Max work in Claude Code?',a:'No. Anthropic says the monthly API credits included with Max plans can\'t be used in Claude Code or the Claude apps; they are for building on the Claude Platform.'}],
